      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The modified BCC matrix will have reduced local electronegativity variation.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lower VEC facilitates shear instability.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5848905::page::002"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Shear instability activates dislocation nucleation before fracture.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5848905::page::002"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enhanced dislocation nucleation and motion will improve room-temperature plasticity.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5848905::page::002"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Retention of the BCC matrix will preserve high compressive yield strength.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5995863::page::001"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The modified alloy will have greater compressive plastic strain than equiatomic NbZrTiHfMo.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5848905::page::002",
        "PMC5995863::page::001"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The modified alloy will suffer little or no dramatic reduction in compressive yield strength.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5995863::page::001"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The beneficial strength-plasticity effect requires only a moderate reduction in Mo content.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Excessive Mo reduction may destabilize the BCC structure or produce unwanted secondary phases.",
